WEBVTT

00:00:03.605 --> 00:00:04.906
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Remember, when you watch TV...

00:00:04.906 --> 00:00:06.274
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Turn on the lights...

00:00:06.274 --> 00:00:07.208
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
and sit back from the TV!

00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:07.642
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:09.940
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Great job, girls!

00:00:21.022 --> 00:00:23.658
The Hound, position still unknown.

00:00:23.658 --> 00:00:25.360
Communications are still out.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.729
Kashiwagi, what's the situation on your end?

00:00:27.729 --> 00:00:29.959
Yes, sir. We're standing by.

00:00:30.698 --> 00:00:34.759
Man, this isn't exactly how I imagined
I'd end up going to bed with you.

00:00:35.103 --> 00:00:37.367
Eek! Wittle Fujiko is embarrassed!

00:00:37.605 --> 00:00:39.368
Je t'aime... Mon amour...

00:00:39.774 --> 00:00:41.276
All right, initiating!

00:00:41.276 --> 00:00:42.800
Psycho Dive!

00:00:45.613 --> 00:00:52.712
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:00:53.721 --> 00:00:59.591
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:07.832
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:08.169 --> 00:01:13.038
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:14.309 --> 00:01:19.838
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:20.248 --> 00:01:24.844
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:01:25.453 --> 00:01:28.356
Limiter (changing myself)

00:01:28.356 --> 00:01:31.484
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:01:31.626 --> 00:01:37.360
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.369
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:44.202
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:01:44.439 --> 00:01:50.605
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:01:50.745 --> 00:01:53.548
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:01:53.548 --> 00:01:56.184
Sora e karitateru yo

00:01:56.184 --> 00:02:01.918
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:02:02.257 --> 00:02:07.786
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:15.837 --> 00:02:16.938
50th sense:
"Giving It All You Have! Over The Future"

00:02:16.938 --> 00:02:17.972
50th sense:
"Giving It All You Have! Over The Future"
Huh? That's funny. I was sure I packed it.

00:02:17.972 --> 00:02:20.202
Huh? That's funny. I was sure I packed it.

00:02:20.742 --> 00:02:23.912
A girl who forgets her textbooks is a waste of air!

00:02:23.912 --> 00:02:24.779
Moe level: zero.

00:02:24.779 --> 00:02:25.370
Say what?!

00:02:25.613 --> 00:02:27.342
Wh-What should I do?

00:02:28.082 --> 00:02:29.447
What? You, too?

00:02:31.286 --> 00:02:33.754
Here, use mine.
It's covered with doodles, though.

00:02:34.722 --> 00:02:37.025
But, what about you?

00:02:37.025 --> 00:02:37.792
It's fine.

00:02:37.792 --> 00:02:39.487
I'll ask the kid next to me to share.

00:02:40.628 --> 00:02:44.532
I forgot mine, too. Can you let
me look at yours next period?

00:02:44.532 --> 00:02:45.692
S-Sure...

00:02:46.234 --> 00:02:48.069
You didn't do this on purpose, did you?

00:02:48.069 --> 00:02:49.737
Just so you could sit close to me?

00:02:49.737 --> 00:02:50.838
No way!

00:02:50.838 --> 00:02:52.237
Who are you, anyway?

00:02:53.308 --> 00:02:53.933
I know!

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.507
All right, next!

00:02:57.078 --> 00:02:59.376
The last line is "The hero's face was crimson!"

00:02:59.447 --> 00:03:02.884
Who was it that made him blush, and why?

00:03:02.884 --> 00:03:04.953
Um... You're sitting a little too close.

00:03:04.953 --> 00:03:06.818
You're really reading it, right?

00:03:09.591 --> 00:03:12.025
Isn't it fun, being classmates, Minamoto?

00:03:12.961 --> 00:03:13.661
Yeah.

00:03:13.661 --> 00:03:15.330
This feels so new and fresh!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:19.167
I've never felt so close to Minamoto before!

00:03:19.167 --> 00:03:24.105
Even though this is just Kyosuke's
illusion and there's a reason behind it...

00:03:24.105 --> 00:03:25.037
I...

00:03:31.646 --> 00:03:35.049
This is the deepest part of
Supervisor Tanizaki's mind.

00:03:35.049 --> 00:03:37.108
We don't have much time. Let's begin.

00:03:41.256 --> 00:03:43.358
Was that thing created by the enemy's power?

00:03:43.358 --> 00:03:45.326
At last, the welcoming committee has arrived.

00:03:45.326 --> 00:03:47.226
Okay, let's give this our best!

00:03:47.495 --> 00:03:49.497
No intruders sighted.

00:03:49.497 --> 00:03:50.691
Nothing sighted!

00:03:50.865 --> 00:03:52.867
Nothing sighted.

00:03:52.867 --> 00:03:56.166
Taking over and initiating search.

00:03:59.173 --> 00:04:00.105
Queen...

00:04:01.743 --> 00:04:03.404
Take this, Minamoto!

00:04:05.947 --> 00:04:07.982
Look out, Minamoto!

00:04:07.982 --> 00:04:08.880
Run!

00:04:09.217 --> 00:04:11.286
Okay, here we go!

00:04:11.286 --> 00:04:13.049
W-Wait, Kaoru!

00:04:14.055 --> 00:04:15.283
Kaoru!

00:04:16.591 --> 00:04:17.492
Here.

00:04:17.492 --> 00:04:19.627
Hey! You can't pass to the enemy!

00:04:19.627 --> 00:04:21.963
But, he just made my heart go zoom!

00:04:21.963 --> 00:04:23.097
Shut up!

00:04:23.097 --> 00:04:25.031
Anyway, now for some payback!

00:04:25.266 --> 00:04:26.167
Bring it on!

00:04:26.167 --> 00:04:28.761
Outta the way! I'll take him down!

00:04:31.306 --> 00:04:32.364
Super...

00:04:33.374 --> 00:04:35.706
Reactive Fast Kick Quick Cannon!

00:04:41.182 --> 00:04:42.149
Foul!

00:04:42.817 --> 00:04:44.952
Are you all right, Minamoto?

00:04:44.952 --> 00:04:48.423
I'm okay, but I feel kind of silly and
my nose won't stop bleeding.

00:04:48.423 --> 00:04:49.412
Teacher, I'll take him to the nurse...

00:04:50.058 --> 00:04:51.993
I'LL take him to the nurse!

00:04:51.993 --> 00:04:53.392
No, I will.

00:04:53.895 --> 00:04:55.123
I will.

00:04:55.363 --> 00:04:57.228
You think I'll let you?

00:05:00.068 --> 00:05:01.558
I'll take you.

00:05:23.324 --> 00:05:24.814
Ew! Bell peppers!

00:05:25.059 --> 00:05:26.527
Huh? You don't like them?

00:05:26.527 --> 00:05:29.553
You always tell us not to
be such fussy eaters.

00:05:30.365 --> 00:05:33.968
Don't worry. Grownup Minamoto didn't
mind them, so you can do it!

00:05:33.968 --> 00:05:35.536
Just do what you always tell Shiho to do.

00:05:35.536 --> 00:05:37.605
Eat it with something you like.

00:05:37.605 --> 00:05:41.132
And adorable little me will help you. Say "ahh"!

00:05:42.076 --> 00:05:43.945
No fair! Step aside, Shiho!

00:05:43.945 --> 00:05:45.947
I'll kiss it to you!

00:05:45.947 --> 00:05:48.279
No, stop it! I'll eat it by myself!

00:05:55.056 --> 00:05:56.614
Good job, Mr. Minamoto!

00:05:57.725 --> 00:05:59.627
Ah... All done!

00:05:59.627 --> 00:06:01.496
Oh, Tono. You always make a mess.

00:06:01.496 --> 00:06:03.361
It's okay! Quit it!

00:06:03.431 --> 00:06:04.523
What's with this class?

00:06:04.966 --> 00:06:07.696
Minamoto! Clean up so we can
go out to the playground!

00:06:08.336 --> 00:06:09.030
Right!

00:06:12.707 --> 00:06:14.231
Wh-What is this place?

00:06:14.876 --> 00:06:16.605
It's time to go back.

00:06:17.779 --> 00:06:20.612
This isn't where we belong.

00:06:21.048 --> 00:06:22.675
This isn't your class.

00:06:23.518 --> 00:06:26.888
I know, but it can't be helped!
It's just for today!

00:06:26.888 --> 00:06:27.547
Exactly.

00:06:28.156 --> 00:06:29.824
Even if you return to normal,

00:06:29.824 --> 00:06:33.385
all that awaits is a future in the
gifted student program, right?

00:06:33.995 --> 00:06:34.829
Who's?

00:06:34.829 --> 00:06:37.457
No! Don't listen to anything he says!

00:06:37.732 --> 00:06:41.327
If you truly wish it,
this doesn't have to be an illusion.

00:06:41.402 --> 00:06:43.597
I can make it real.

00:06:44.806 --> 00:06:50.244
I'll erase your memories completely
and give you a child's body for real.

00:06:50.578 --> 00:06:51.779
Hyobu, what are you?

00:06:51.779 --> 00:06:54.916
It's not impossible if I use all of my life energy.

00:06:54.916 --> 00:06:56.217
Really?

00:06:56.217 --> 00:06:58.981
Fujiko and that quack are moving in
on the one who did this to you.

00:06:59.387 --> 00:07:03.221
It's just a matter of time till they find
a way to return you to normal.

00:07:04.292 --> 00:07:07.094
But if you want what I'm offering,
then come to the roof.

00:07:07.094 --> 00:07:08.425
I'll be there.

00:07:09.397 --> 00:07:11.799
I could stay like this...

00:07:11.799 --> 00:07:13.699
Don't believe that ridiculous story!

00:07:14.001 --> 00:07:15.102
Why not?!

00:07:15.102 --> 00:07:18.560
You know how much I just
wanted to be a normal kid!

00:07:19.006 --> 00:07:23.443
How much I wanted to grow up
like this with kids my own age!

00:07:24.145 --> 00:07:28.850
I do. But our past wasn't wasted.

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:33.446
We're able to help Kaoru and the
others because of how hard it was.

00:07:33.754 --> 00:07:35.051
But!

00:07:36.757 --> 00:07:38.987
Hey! Wait!

00:07:40.795 --> 00:07:42.319
What's wrong, Minamoto?

00:07:42.396 --> 00:07:43.192
N-Nothing.

00:07:43.431 --> 00:07:45.500
Could your memories have returned?

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.262
That must be it!

00:07:48.202 --> 00:07:49.760
Your recovery is proceeding.

00:07:50.338 --> 00:07:52.738
Looks like you really being treated.

00:07:53.841 --> 00:07:55.376
The major wouldn't lie!

00:07:55.376 --> 00:07:57.640
Well, sometimes... I mean, he doesn't!

00:07:58.012 --> 00:07:58.980
That's great!

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:01.382
You should be back to normal by tonight.

00:08:01.382 --> 00:08:02.849
That's a relief.

00:08:03.217 --> 00:08:04.013
Why?

00:08:04.619 --> 00:08:08.487
Didn't you say you liked having me the
same age, in the same class with you?!

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.958
Well, yeah, but...

00:08:10.958 --> 00:08:11.617
But...

00:08:12.994 --> 00:08:15.563
I don't want to go back to normal!

00:08:15.563 --> 00:08:16.962
Wait! Mr. Minamoto!

00:08:17.031 --> 00:08:17.861
What's wrong?!

00:08:19.367 --> 00:08:21.961
Yeah. If I choose to now...

00:08:25.406 --> 00:08:27.874
Hi there. I see you came.

00:08:28.276 --> 00:08:30.642
I've been waiting for you, Minamoto.

00:08:33.481 --> 00:08:36.882
I don't want my real future!

00:08:38.252 --> 00:08:41.085
Did I let you have enough fun?

00:08:42.657 --> 00:08:44.625
It looks like some sort of album is coming out.

00:08:44.625 --> 00:08:45.426
Really?

00:08:45.426 --> 00:08:46.916
Let's buy it! Let's buy it!

00:08:48.195 --> 00:08:50.698
This is taking too long,
no matter what they ran into.

00:08:50.698 --> 00:08:52.359
What's going on in there?

00:08:57.972 --> 00:09:00.770
There's no end to it!
Director, aren't you finished yet?!

00:09:01.042 --> 00:09:02.634
Hang on! Nearly there!

00:09:03.911 --> 00:09:07.506
I see. This is the one in charge
of Black Phantom's brainwashing.

00:09:09.717 --> 00:09:10.649
The boost!

00:09:11.385 --> 00:09:12.219
Huh?

00:09:12.219 --> 00:09:15.022
The Children's Triple Boost
should take care of these!

00:09:15.022 --> 00:09:17.858
We have to get out of here and tell the girls!

00:09:17.858 --> 00:09:21.760
That may be easier said than done.

00:09:22.296 --> 00:09:26.033
I see. So, the men we
captured the other day were...

00:09:26.033 --> 00:09:29.059
Yes, they seem to have ties to Black Phantom.

00:09:29.537 --> 00:09:32.563
They were apparently contracted to
smuggle their espers into the country,

00:09:32.907 --> 00:09:36.809
and there are traces that they
guided one in just the other day.

00:09:37.311 --> 00:09:39.513
I see... So, both men were attacked...

00:09:39.513 --> 00:09:42.914
in retaliation for the incidents
with Barrett and Tim.

00:09:43.551 --> 00:09:44.950
Chief!

00:09:45.319 --> 00:09:47.844
Tokiwa! Nowaki! What's wrong?!

00:09:49.457 --> 00:09:51.288
This just flew into the lobby.

00:09:52.159 --> 00:09:54.462
I'll link you telepathically.

00:09:54.462 --> 00:09:57.465
Chief! It's me, Akira.

00:09:57.465 --> 00:09:59.763
Yadorigi?! Where are you?!

00:10:00.034 --> 00:10:03.060
I'm sorry, sir. I only transferred
part of my mind into this bird.

00:10:03.704 --> 00:10:06.741
We need backup, now...
She's after Kaoru and the others...

00:10:06.741 --> 00:10:08.902
Hang on! Where are you now?

00:10:09.176 --> 00:10:11.406
The girls'... school...

00:10:14.615 --> 00:10:15.883
Emergency scramble!

00:10:15.883 --> 00:10:19.153
Send all teams near Rokujoin
elementary school to there, at once!

00:10:19.153 --> 00:10:21.178
Minamoto! Hey!

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.685
Jeez, where'd he go?

00:10:31.232 --> 00:10:32.133
What?

00:10:32.133 --> 00:10:35.227
I'm going to have a look at
your memories, Kaoru Akashi.

00:10:38.339 --> 00:10:39.507
Strange...

00:10:39.507 --> 00:10:42.908
Had you forgotten these
memories yourself till now?

00:10:46.247 --> 00:10:47.771
Wh-What is this?

00:10:48.482 --> 00:10:51.542
Is that really me? Why am I a grownup?

00:10:52.086 --> 00:10:53.018
Why..?

00:10:53.387 --> 00:10:56.117
Why is Minamoto aiming that at me?

00:10:57.992 --> 00:11:00.294
Is this the true face of "the queen"?

00:11:00.294 --> 00:11:03.730
This girl is to become the
future queen of all espers?

00:11:05.232 --> 00:11:06.267
Shiho!

00:11:06.267 --> 00:11:07.427
Find them?

00:11:07.735 --> 00:11:09.904
No! What's going on?

00:11:09.904 --> 00:11:12.464
I can't find Mr. Minamoto or Kaoru anywhere!

00:11:14.842 --> 00:11:15.399
Mio!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.179
Huh, who?

00:11:18.179 --> 00:11:20.548
The girl who was just sitting at this desk!

00:11:20.548 --> 00:11:21.949
The really, really dumb one?

00:11:21.949 --> 00:11:24.918
I don't know her. No one sits there.

00:11:25.853 --> 00:11:28.155
They've started something.

00:11:28.155 --> 00:11:29.087
What do we do?

00:11:31.492 --> 00:11:32.390
Who are you?

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.395
You can call me Hyobu.

00:11:34.395 --> 00:11:38.632
Is what you said true?
Why would you do that for me?

00:11:38.632 --> 00:11:42.329
Yes... As you are now, I can tell you.

00:11:43.571 --> 00:11:48.338
I like The Children. Especially Kaoru.

00:11:49.143 --> 00:11:51.111
You might even say that I love her.

00:11:52.413 --> 00:11:54.782
What kind of kid says stuff like that?

00:11:54.782 --> 00:11:55.476
Pervert!

00:11:56.717 --> 00:12:00.209
I'm not a kid. Besides, I don't mean it like that.

00:12:03.791 --> 00:12:05.693
They're so rude.

00:12:05.693 --> 00:12:09.220
We were about to get a
once-in-a-lifetime decision, here.

00:12:13.167 --> 00:12:15.067
You shall not pass!

00:12:15.436 --> 00:12:16.460
Mr. Kugutsu?

00:12:16.804 --> 00:12:19.173
Hello, Miss Umegae. It's been a while.

00:12:19.173 --> 00:12:21.198
How've you and Supervisor
Tanizaki been, lately?

00:12:21.275 --> 00:12:22.643
Hey, why's he here?

00:12:22.643 --> 00:12:24.578
Aren't we facing Black Phantom?

00:12:24.578 --> 00:12:26.380
I'll make you let us pass!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:27.281
PSYCHIC...

00:12:27.281 --> 00:12:28.612
Educational Guidance!

00:12:34.455 --> 00:12:38.323
No stun subjections on the school grounds!

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:45.326
Kaoru is what I once was.
Before I was wounded.

00:12:45.833 --> 00:12:50.237
One day, fate will lead her
down a path similar to my own.

00:12:50.237 --> 00:12:53.673
I think you and I both want
to create a different future.

00:12:54.141 --> 00:12:57.645
But I cannot forgive those who betrayed me.

00:12:57.645 --> 00:13:00.414
I'm going to eradicate every Normal
from the face of the Earth.

00:13:00.414 --> 00:13:02.245
I will not allow that future to be changed!

00:13:03.417 --> 00:13:06.487
So, what's that got to do with me and Kaoru?!

00:13:06.487 --> 00:13:11.158
You have no idea how many
times I considered killing you.

00:13:11.158 --> 00:13:13.820
I still want to. It would be so easy...

00:13:14.628 --> 00:13:17.698
But if I kill you, the queen could not live.

00:13:17.698 --> 00:13:20.861
And if you live, she will die.

00:13:21.869 --> 00:13:22.563
What?

00:13:22.837 --> 00:13:24.771
Such is our fate.

00:13:25.272 --> 00:13:27.474
It seems difficult to square my vengeance...

00:13:27.474 --> 00:13:30.170
and her happiness in this time line.

00:13:33.614 --> 00:13:35.605
Queen, I...

00:13:36.684 --> 00:13:38.618
What are you doing, Yuuri?

00:13:38.719 --> 00:13:40.487
Finish her off at once!

00:13:40.487 --> 00:13:44.446
No one but Black Phantom must
be allowed to control espers!

00:13:44.825 --> 00:13:46.349
Father?!

00:13:46.427 --> 00:13:48.418
But, this girl is...

00:13:53.033 --> 00:13:54.762
Get away from Kaoru!

00:13:59.974 --> 00:14:01.771
Kaoru, are you okay?

00:14:03.277 --> 00:14:04.141
Naomi?

00:14:05.145 --> 00:14:10.048
Please, your supervisor... Save your Minamoto...

00:14:11.785 --> 00:14:12.774
Naomi!

00:14:14.121 --> 00:14:15.489
Well, Shiho?

00:14:15.489 --> 00:14:16.657
Leave it to me.

00:14:16.657 --> 00:14:18.818
It doesn't matter if it's faint.
If I just get a hint of their presence...

00:14:19.593 --> 00:14:20.560
Found them!

00:14:21.896 --> 00:14:25.332
I don't really understand,
but if I stay a kid, then...

00:14:25.332 --> 00:14:28.402
Correct. Everything works out.

00:14:28.402 --> 00:14:31.803
Right now, your brain can be
completely reformatted.

00:14:32.406 --> 00:14:34.738
You'll never get a chance like this again.

00:14:35.509 --> 00:14:36.339
What?

00:14:36.577 --> 00:14:40.411
Touch the screw on his forehead.
Do that, and you'll...

00:14:40.481 --> 00:14:41.345
Wait!

00:14:42.116 --> 00:14:43.083
Kaoru?

00:14:43.083 --> 00:14:44.184
Queen.

00:14:44.184 --> 00:14:48.188
Is that you, Kyosuke?
I'm begging you, don't do this!

00:14:48.188 --> 00:14:49.849
Minamoto can't stay like that!

00:14:50.224 --> 00:14:53.591
But it's what he wants, Queen.

00:14:53.661 --> 00:14:57.798
It's not like he'll disappear.
He'll just become a child again.

00:14:57.798 --> 00:14:59.026
But... But!

00:14:59.233 --> 00:15:01.936
I won't just rejuvenate his cells.

00:15:01.936 --> 00:15:05.633
It's possible the effects of my powers
may give him weak ESP, as well.

00:15:06.707 --> 00:15:10.277
You could live as equals, and grow up together.

00:15:10.277 --> 00:15:11.676
It's not a bad future, is it?

00:15:11.979 --> 00:15:12.846
There's no way...

00:15:12.846 --> 00:15:13.914
we can let you do that!

00:15:13.914 --> 00:15:14.648
Aoi! Shiho!

00:15:14.648 --> 00:15:16.350
Don't underestimate me.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.319
I can most certainly do it...
If I get serious about this.

00:15:20.921 --> 00:15:24.058
Um..."Get serious" meaning what, exactly?

00:15:24.058 --> 00:15:27.050
I think he's intending to use all of his life energy.

00:15:27.695 --> 00:15:28.729
Seriously?!

00:15:28.729 --> 00:15:29.797
We have to stop him!

00:15:29.797 --> 00:15:33.198
Why? Is using all your life energy bad?

00:15:33.968 --> 00:15:35.196
THREE MINUTE YAKISOBA

00:15:35.669 --> 00:15:36.670
He'll die!

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:39.740
We can't. Orders. He said not to interfere.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.407
But!

00:15:40.407 --> 00:15:43.774
Don't worry. This is the major.
He'll change his mind in a minute.

00:15:45.479 --> 00:15:46.946
He has to.

00:15:47.147 --> 00:15:49.650
Don't! I know this is fun, but!

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:51.584
We like being with you, Mr. Minamoto, but!

00:15:51.652 --> 00:15:52.914
That's right! This is wrong!

00:15:53.287 --> 00:15:54.151
I...

00:15:54.922 --> 00:15:56.446
Don't my feelings count?

00:15:57.458 --> 00:15:58.325
Minamoto?

00:15:58.325 --> 00:16:02.296
If I get a second chance,
we can go living every day like today!

00:16:02.296 --> 00:16:06.255
If I go back to being an adult,
we can't be friends like this anymore!

00:16:07.668 --> 00:16:10.137
That may be fine with you, but not for me!

00:16:10.137 --> 00:16:11.104
Minamoto!

00:16:11.338 --> 00:16:15.297
Even if you're not a kid,
we'll still grow up and follow you!

00:16:15.609 --> 00:16:19.010
Kaoru... Aoi... Shiho...

00:16:20.881 --> 00:16:25.079
After all, you still haven't given
me the answer from that time!

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:29.683
I'll answer that when I meet the real you.

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:33.316
Really? Then promise me.

00:16:36.797 --> 00:16:38.992
Huh? What was I just saying?

00:16:40.367 --> 00:16:41.459
I...

00:16:42.836 --> 00:16:44.736
No, you don't...

00:16:45.172 --> 00:16:47.470
You're just getting... IN THE WAY!

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:54.615
Wh-What the?!

00:16:54.615 --> 00:16:55.639
That's!

00:16:55.716 --> 00:16:56.842
Black Phantom!

00:16:57.818 --> 00:16:58.716
Minamoto!

00:16:59.686 --> 00:17:01.381
Minamoto is Minamoto.

00:17:01.555 --> 00:17:06.627
A Normal, ten years older than us,
who always treats us like kids.

00:17:06.627 --> 00:17:08.561
Who's stupidly nice to us!

00:17:09.029 --> 00:17:10.397
Minamoto, please!

00:17:10.397 --> 00:17:11.331
Believe!

00:17:11.331 --> 00:17:12.662
Believe in us!

00:17:14.034 --> 00:17:16.002
What will you do, Minamoto?

00:17:16.537 --> 00:17:19.734
That's right. I shouldn't have forgotten.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:22.743
We've been together. We always have.

00:17:22.743 --> 00:17:24.540
And we always will!

00:17:25.112 --> 00:17:29.208
Kaoru! Aoi! Shiho! I say these words to you!

00:17:29.483 --> 00:17:30.472
Minamoto!

00:17:30.818 --> 00:17:35.289
Special espers, The Children!
Triple boost, full release!

00:17:35.289 --> 00:17:35.778
< < FULL RELEASE> >
Special espers, The Children!
Triple boost, full release!

00:17:38.258 --> 00:17:40.694
For the days which we will spend with you!

00:17:40.694 --> 00:17:42.830
For the bonds which are not an illusion!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.798
Strongly, gallantly, we beat these wings!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.831
Come back to us, Minamoto.

00:17:52.106 --> 00:17:55.940
I want to be with the old Minamoto,
the Minamoto I knew!

00:18:00.447 --> 00:18:01.215
What?!

00:18:01.215 --> 00:18:02.910
It's Kaoru!

00:18:05.219 --> 00:18:08.814
This is the power that will save the future.

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.252
Kaoru!

00:18:18.966 --> 00:18:19.990
It's beautiful...

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:26.829
Minamoto!

00:18:45.826 --> 00:18:46.588
You okay?

00:18:47.027 --> 00:18:48.790
Y-Yeah...

00:18:49.263 --> 00:18:50.924
I'm back, everyone.

00:18:51.398 --> 00:18:54.959
And thanks. For worrying about me.

00:18:58.672 --> 00:19:00.469
Minamoto, you son of a!

00:19:10.484 --> 00:19:11.212
Mr. Minamoto!

00:19:11.585 --> 00:19:13.348
Shoot me, if you like.

00:19:13.554 --> 00:19:15.681
If that will satisfy your vengeance.

00:19:15.856 --> 00:19:18.654
How about you shoot me? Here's your chance.

00:19:20.194 --> 00:19:22.458
I won't take that option. Besides...

00:19:24.331 --> 00:19:28.927
I need for you to see the future these
girls and I are going to create.

00:19:31.705 --> 00:19:33.536
Don't die, Hyobu.

00:19:33.607 --> 00:19:35.575
We'll get another chance to settle our feud.

00:19:36.843 --> 00:19:40.176
And I appreciate your giving
me a day like no other.

00:19:47.454 --> 00:19:50.389
Well, well... I've failed again.

00:19:50.624 --> 00:19:55.823
I must be losing my charisma.
Think so, Magi? Momiji? Yoh?

00:19:57.164 --> 00:19:58.799
Don't be ridiculous.

00:19:58.799 --> 00:20:00.367
We would have suffered for your success!

00:20:00.367 --> 00:20:03.904
Exactly! You were just gonna die
and leave me to lead PANDRA?!

00:20:03.904 --> 00:20:05.565
No, I never said that.

00:20:07.374 --> 00:20:09.501
You really care about those brats that much?

00:20:11.378 --> 00:20:12.879
C'mon, let's get going!

00:20:12.879 --> 00:20:14.314
Hey, I'm not finished...

00:20:14.314 --> 00:20:15.645
I'm sorry.

00:20:15.816 --> 00:20:17.684
Thanks to you all, I've had a lot of fun lately,

00:20:17.684 --> 00:20:19.208
and I caused you some grief without meaning to.

00:20:19.853 --> 00:20:23.482
I thought this would work,
but got rejected in the end.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.725
Let's try to live long enough
to see the next chance.

00:20:27.094 --> 00:20:31.164
We're considering our own ways to
safely get the queen in our hands.

00:20:31.164 --> 00:20:33.655
Don't try anything like this again.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:34.357
Otherwise...

00:20:35.469 --> 00:20:38.961
you'll just end up making us look
like fools for staying with you.

00:20:42.075 --> 00:20:43.167
I see.

00:20:46.113 --> 00:20:47.478
I'll keep that in mind.

00:20:52.019 --> 00:20:54.254
The Hound team has been found!

00:20:54.254 --> 00:20:56.017
Thank goodness! They're all safe!

00:20:56.256 --> 00:20:58.121
Akira, I'm hungry.

00:20:58.191 --> 00:21:00.091
That's a fundamental of life.

00:21:00.227 --> 00:21:02.963
Hatsune, come for your sausages! Sausages!

00:21:02.963 --> 00:21:04.089
FOOD!

00:21:05.465 --> 00:21:07.234
What have I been doing?

00:21:07.234 --> 00:21:09.436
He seems to be back to normal.

00:21:09.436 --> 00:21:11.605
You think Minamoto is, too?

00:21:11.605 --> 00:21:12.537
Supervisor!

00:21:13.006 --> 00:21:15.941
You're awake, Supervisor Tanizaki!

00:21:16.843 --> 00:21:18.606
Do you know who I am?

00:21:21.415 --> 00:21:24.518
This is a dream! This can't be happening!

00:21:24.518 --> 00:21:26.042
That's not my Naomi!

00:21:26.286 --> 00:21:28.686
My Naomi would get mad and hit me!

00:21:30.924 --> 00:21:32.292
This is Kashiwagi.

00:21:32.292 --> 00:21:34.920
Mission accomplished. No problems.

00:21:36.596 --> 00:21:38.427
Good job. I can report the same.

00:21:40.033 --> 00:21:42.336
I still have some regrets, though.

00:21:42.336 --> 00:21:45.105
Yeah. Mini Minamoto was cute.

00:21:45.105 --> 00:21:47.374
Hey, don't tease adults!

00:21:47.374 --> 00:21:49.706
And there you go again, treating us like kids!

00:21:50.177 --> 00:21:51.610
I swear, we're!

00:21:52.646 --> 00:21:53.780
Yeah.

00:21:53.780 --> 00:21:57.375
Compared to when we first met,
you're a little more mature.

00:21:58.485 --> 00:21:59.853
Really?

00:21:59.853 --> 00:22:03.156
Okay, then which one of us is the sexiest?!

00:22:03.156 --> 00:22:03.986
Me, right?

00:22:04.458 --> 00:22:05.322
Gotta be me.

00:22:07.194 --> 00:22:09.129
Don't get carried away.

00:22:09.129 --> 00:22:11.563
Let's get back. Everyone's waiting.

00:22:12.265 --> 00:22:13.994
Don't avoid the question!

00:22:30.951 --> 00:22:34.478
Mae wo muite Yume wo daite

00:22:34.554 --> 00:22:38.492
Kokoro kimete Miageru sora

00:22:38.492 --> 00:22:44.564
Mirai wo koeru Watashi no tsubasa de

00:22:44.564 --> 00:22:48.435
Anata dake ga daihon'me!

00:22:48.435 --> 00:22:52.406
Zettai love! Sengen shita

00:22:52.406 --> 00:22:58.311
Kira-kira shiteta kisetsu ga sugiteku

00:22:59.045 --> 00:23:03.083
Kinen shashin no anata wa

00:23:03.083 --> 00:23:06.951
Kawaranai komarikao

00:23:07.554 --> 00:23:13.789
Yasashikutte atatakakute namida ga dechau

00:23:14.995 --> 00:23:18.565
Ashita mo koko de aeru mitai ni

00:23:18.565 --> 00:23:22.135
Yakusoku shinaide yukou

00:23:22.135 --> 00:23:26.106
Itsumo no you ni sarigenaku

00:23:26.106 --> 00:23:31.339
Egao de chiisaku te wo futta

00:23:32.345 --> 00:23:37.146
"Jaa... Mata ne"

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:51.031
< < NEXT EPISODE> >

00:23:51.031 --> 00:23:51.998
< < NEXT EPISODE> >
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:51.998 --> 00:23:53.329
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:55.991
We can be anything. We can go anywhere.

00:23:56.670 --> 00:23:57.838
That's right.

00:23:57.838 --> 00:24:01.074
Because we're the most powerful espers.

00:24:01.074 --> 00:24:03.167
Thanks, Mr. Minamoto.

00:24:03.276 --> 00:24:05.836
That's right. I'm with you.

00:24:06.713 --> 00:24:09.477
I always will be, until you're grown.

00:24:09.950 --> 00:24:11.485
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:11.485 --> 00:24:12.586
The final episode!

00:24:12.586 --> 00:24:15.146
"A Riot of Cherry Blossoms!
Bye-Bye, Till We Meet Again"

00:24:15.355 --> 00:24:16.656
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:16.656 --> 00:24:17.824
A Riot of Cherry Blossoms!
Bye-Bye, Till We Meet Again
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:17.824 --> 00:24:19.917
A Riot of Cherry Blossoms!
Bye-Bye, Till We Meet Again
